Model from:

A.A. Konnov, "Implementation of the NCN pathway of prompt-NO formation
in the detailed reaction mechanism", Combust. Flame 156 (2009) 2093-2105.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.combustflame.2009.03.016

with following modifications:

(1) Remove unupported keyword in REACTIONS line in mechanism file
(2) Reformat ELEM block
(3) Refit thermodynamic data to eliminate discontinuities

